window.products.push({"id":994021,"name":"T-fal FR4008002 Pro Fry Filtra 2.6 lb Immersion Fryer, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XE52M031L._AC_.jpg","description":"The T-Fal FR4008002 Pro Fry Filtra Deep Fryer features the following: 17 cup oil capacity - 2.65 lbs. of food; Stainless Steel exterior and lid give it a professional look; Patented Filtration System, filter your oil while removing the element -- The oil remains cleaner and can be reused longer than in a traditional fryer; All parts are dishwasher safe, for hassle free cleanups (including fryer body and excluding heating element); Viewing window and cool-touch handle on the lid; Permanent metal filter, integrated into the lid for minimal cooking odors; Cool-zone, keeps the oil temperature lower in the bottom so the crumbs do not burn; Folding basket handle for easy storage; Two position basket, high position to drain the food and low position to cook; Adjustable thermostat, select the perfect cooking temperature for all your cooking needs; On/Temperature-ready light, turns off when oil reaches correct frying temperature; Detachable magnetic safety plug for advanced safety in the kitchen; 1700w Power.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XE52M031L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B0002X5PQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002X5PQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002X5PQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994022,"name":"Science Fiction Hanging Mobile - 10 Inches - Wooden Ball - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rj6Uymd1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rj6Uymd1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B0010YPY7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0010YPY7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0010YPY7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
