window.products.push({"id":994136,"name":"Gallon Cold Brew Coffee Maker - Mason Style 4 Quart Glass Jar with Stainless Steel Mesh Filter Insert and Flip Top Pour Lid and Handle- by kitchentool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OjIP0+a6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy brewing your own batch of fresh cold brew coffee without acidity while saving money using your own durable gallon mason jar brewer. 128 oz. Gallon Clear Glass Jar This 1 Gallon capacity glass jar with a 110 mm (110-400) continuous thread finish looks great and has a clean cut look. While created esthetically to please the eye and profound clarity this jar is still created in the USA with superior quality craftsmanship. Extra Strength Durable Stainless Steel Mesh Filter Insert Our Mesh filter insert was created with the highest quality material and therefore will not crack or corrode, lasting you many years of repeated usage. Lid with Pour Cap and Handle (Lid is NOT watertight. Jar should be stored vertically only!) This Pour Cap will allow you to pour your freshly chilled cold brew from your glass jar without spilling. The handle will give you the right leverage needed so you can safely hold on to the bottom of the jar with your other hand. Wide Mouth Jar With a generous 4 inch (110 mm) circumference opening, these jars will eliminate messes when pouring your finely ground coffee grounds. The wide mouth will also allow easy access with one's hand or preferred kitchen utensil. All-purpose Kitchen Tool Jars can also be used for pickles, pickled eggs, kombucha, and various bulk storage items. Kitchentoolz Jars will suit your needs when it comes to brewing and fermenting wine, beer, kombucha, kefir, and all sorts of fun teas. The jar will keep its contents safe from the outside elements for long periods of time. Easy Breezy Cleaning To clean; wash the jars and filter insert by hand in soap and warm water or place in dishwasher for a quick safe clean! Lids should be washed by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OjIP0+a6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kitchentoolz","source_asin":"B07L9HXG6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L9HXG6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L9HXG6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
