window.products.push({"id":994188,"name":"Cozy Bliss Soft Cashmere Like Throw Blanket Lightweight Warm Blanket with Tassels for Couch Sofa Bedroom Travel (Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ozuwYwNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUS COMFORT ALL YEAR LONG: This super soft traveling blanket is made from 100% breathable polyster with decorative fringes. The throw blanket is luxuriously soft, which will keep you cozy in the cold winter months and comfy in the summer. THROW SIZE: Our soft blanket measures 60 x 50 inches, which is the perfect size as your personal throw while still being very portable. You can easily roll up this blanket and take it with you when traveling.You can also snuggle it on sofa to watch TV on a chilly winter night. The blanket works perfectly for decorating a sofa or armchair, giving a more sophisticated look to an entire space. ADVANCED TECHNIQUE: Antistatic yarns, breathable fibers, and a double decoloring process allow us to create the most comfortable and nice-looking blanket for the most enjoyable experience. EASY CARE: Not only it looks and feels amazing, it's also very durable and easy to maintain. We recommend washing in cold water with a gentle detergent (no fabric softener). Tumble dry on your lowest dryer setting with low heat (do not iron). It is recommended to wash before the first use. 100% SATISFACTION: We’re so confident that you’re going to love our luxurious throw blankets that we back them with a No Hassle 60 Day Money Back Guarantee. Give one a try and see for yourself. You won’t be disappointed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ozuwYwNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Bliss","source_asin":"B0BRQ61NHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQ61NHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQ61NHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
