window.products.push({"id":994271,"name":"Under the Sea Mermaid Treasure Birthday Party Invitations, 20 5\"x7\" Fill In Cards with Twenty White Envelopes by AmandaCreation, Mermaid with Light Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LyY9+uDkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"*** Bigger... Better... and Best of All... Cuter. Presenting Mermaid Birthday Party Invitations for girls, Designed by a Mom for Moms. Set of 20 Fill-In Postcards (5\"x7\" Each) Comes with 20 White Envelopes *** You want your precious girl to have a very special party, with invitations to match. That's why we recommend these Mermaid Birthday Invites. Crafted for superior quality, they offer: *Super-cute design, combining a beautiful pink haired mermaid, under the sea decor & even treasure chest graphics in a unique, kid-pleasing pattern *2-sided printing for that added pop of color & extra touch of quality *Fill-in areas where you can write your child's name & age... her party time, date & place... plus how to RSVP *Larger 5\"x7\" size for bigger visual impact (most others are only 4\"x5.5\") *Heftier 80# cardstock with a smooth matte finish (so it's easier to write on) Even Includes Custom-Size Envelopes Hunting for just the right envelopes? Rest easy. Your 20 birthday postcards come with 20 crisp white envelopes, perfectly sized to fit the cards perfectly. What's more, you can count on these eye-popping invites for all-American craftsmanship: They're designed, printed & carefully hand-packaged right here in the USA. To top it off, the complete set is fully backed by Amazon's 30-Day Guarantee. OMG, They're the Absolute Cutest... So Add to Cart Right Away... in Time for Your Daughter's Big Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LyY9+uDkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amanda Creation","source_asin":"B01HLBY0WO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HLBY0WO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HLBY0WO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994272,"name":"RSVP International (BEATR-RD) Handheld Vintage Inspired Egg Beater, 18/8 Stainless Steel Dishwasher Safe, 12.25 Inch, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PiJNfG7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rsvp strives to offer quality kitchen products and cooking tools at competitive prices. Our retro egg beater is a perfect example. Get the look of an antique egg beater with up-to-date performance with this RSVP endurance vintage style beater. Made from durable 18/8 stainless steel, this old fashioned egg beater has a smooth crank with Red acrylic handles. The gears glide along smoothly and will whip eggs or heavy cream in no time. This vintage egg beater is sure to impress guests and turn cooking into a Fun experience for everyone. When all the right people, and ingredients, kitchen tools, and food come together, we call this the art of gathering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PiJNfG7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RSVP International","source_asin":"B004TGTPIY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004TGTPIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004TGTPIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
