window.products.push({"id":994360,"name":"Electric Space Heater - Merece 1500W PTC Portable Space Heaters for Indoor Use Home Office Bedroom Garage with Thermostat, Small Desk Room Heater 3 Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Sb36nsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【INSTANTLY HEAT UP WITHIN 3S】 Are you feeling freezing through the winter? Turn on Merece space heate for home, which use the PTC heating element, it will heat up instantly & warm the air around you quickly. With 1500W of comforting warmth and Widespread heating function, no need to preheat, this ceramic space heater will push the coll out of your room and offer a warm home or a warm office. No longer feeling cold in this winter! 【TIP-OVER and OVER-HEAT AUTO-OFF】 Our portable heater is equipped with TIP-OVER and OVER-HEATING for safety concerns. Since our small space heater is easy to move, they may be easier to kick down. Therefore, we add the tip-over feature in the case of these situations. This safe space heater will shut off once it tipped over. The electric heater can also automatically shut off when overheat temperature is reached to 167℉（75℃）. Once it cools down, it will start working again. 【ADJUSTABLE THREE MODEs and THERMOSTAT】This space heater for indoor use carry three power modes, which allows the room heater to blow warm air flow at different speeds.The space heater for office will work on 1500W/750W while in High/Low mode. The natural wind mode will allow you to comfortable in Summer. Also, you can turn on the ADJUSTABLE THERMOSTAT to maintain your desired temperature of the room. Which is really energy-saving than the central air conditioning. 【NO BOTHERING NOISE, One Space Heater for All Room】This electric space heater’s blower is so quiet, you’ll hardly notice it’s on. The indoor space heater will not interfere with your sleeping, studying, reading, or working, offering you a quiet space with ultra comfort. Moreover, this portable space heater is designed with a back handle for you to carry it around. It is a lightweight, compact space heater for bedroom, so you can put it in your living room in the daytime, in the bedroom at night. 【IDEAL FOR PERSONAL USE】 Do you feel cold when working in the big office? Especially the freeze legs? You might need a personal heater. This space heater with thermostat is perfect for your office desk space and keep your feet and legs warm under the desk. Also, this desk space heater can be used on the desk to warm your hands. Ideal space heater for personal use and keep you warm in the office, home, bedroom, bathroom, garage, and any other place!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Sb36nsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merece","source_asin":"B08B1BC832","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B1BC832","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B1BC832","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
