window.products.push({"id":994507,"name":"OUII Aluminum Pizza Peel Metal - 12 x 14 Inch. Pizza Spatula for Oven with Foldable Wood Handle. Pizza Oven Accessories and Pizza Tools. Pizza Turning","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nTLZ6gDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ Adjust & Lock: Aside from the slender thickness and lightweight aluminum that allows you to move pizza pies with feather-light ease, the other great thing about the OUII Metal Pizza Peel is the Adjust-Swivel & Lock Handle! It compacts down for storage, extends to a full 25” length to protect against burns or deep pizza ovens, and it rotates for easy access around the pie, or in small spaces. ⭐ Load Up Your Heaviest Pie! Even when fully extended to 25”, this pizza shovel can withstand the most laden-down, 14” pizza (… did someone say Triple Cheese?). With a 12 x 14” aluminum plate, and pinewood handle, it’s a lightweight tool that doesn’t add extra burden to your hands when carrying that mountain of a pie. The 2mm “cookie sheet” thickness will never bend, and slides effortlessly. ⭐ Easy To Use: First, don’t use it as a pizza board to cut pizza - you’ll damage your blades! Second, for dough that’s too wet, simply sprinkle your pizza peel metal surface with a little corn flour to help your pizza slide easier. And lastly, have fun! The strong handle makes it great for bread and cakes too! ⭐ Easy To Clean: When it’s time to tidy, simply remove the wood handle to wipe clean, and handwash the pizza slider with a soft sponge to prevent scratching. And because the plate is Rust-Proof Aluminum and not wood, it’s light, resistant to humidity, won’t chip, warp or splinter. ⭐ Gift Ready: The OUII Pizza Peel will arrive in GIFT READY packaging, so you can gift it to someone who needs to serve better pizza for YOU! OUII, make every pie a mess-free masterpiece – try it now and see!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nTLZ6gDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OUII","source_asin":"B0C239W88M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C239W88M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C239W88M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
