window.products.push({"id":994588,"name":"Tomato Man Portable Air Conditioner Window Seal Kit, Air Conditioner Window Ventilation Kit with 5.9\" Air Conditioner Vent Hose for Air Conditioner Fl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pEYPHbVML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Quality Seal Kit] - The window unit's air conditioning cover is made of a quality thickened waterproof and insulating fabric that is resistant to ageing and will last year after year. The window seal on this portable air conditioning kit keeps cool air in your room by effectively spreading hot air out of the window. This window seal locks the air conditioner's hose tightly between the window and the window frame. It is suitable for windows with a maximum circumference of 158 inches [Easy to Install ] - No drilling required. You don't need to buy window kits, adapters for hoses or extra tools. Simply apply the hook tape to the inside of your window frame and to the window itself. Apply the window seal to the hook tape. Then, open the zip on the window seal and place the air conditioning hose outside the window. Finally, tighten the zip around the hose. Easy as pie. [Universal Design] - Our air conditioning exhaust hose has a counter-clockwise thread, so be sure to check if this will fit your air conditioner before you buy. Our air conditioning hoses have a diameter of 5.9 inches and a minimum length, which is 15 inches, or extend it fully to 80 inches. This means it will fit most portable air conditioners on the market, including LG, Frigidaire, Whynter, SPT, Honeywell, Haier, Emerson and Newair. 【Lasting Design]- The exhaust hose is made of high quality polypropylene combined with an internal steel ring, which makes it flexible and heat resistant to wear and tear, even if you use it for years without leaking. The air conditioning hose can be extended to fit existing vents by aligning the front end of the hose and threading on a unit specific coupler (sold separately, usually with the air conditioning unit). [100% Satisfaction Guarantee] - Not sure how to choose the right size? Worried about installation? Received a defective item? If there are any questions or concerns, you can easily contact us on Amazon and if our portable air conditioning kits leave you hot and bothered, we will refund your purchase price in full!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pEYPHbVML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tomato Man","source_asin":"B09S14C8DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S14C8DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S14C8DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994589,"name":"ANPOPO Heart Cookie Cutters for Anniversary, Bridal, Engagement and Valentine - 7 Piece Stainless Steel Heart Shapes 1.57in, 1.97in, 2.36in, 2.76in, 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615nDRJrV5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤️Heart cookie cutter set❤️ This collection of different heart-shaped biscuit molds can be used in various theme party decorations to add a love atmosphere to special holiday. Set Includes (7 pieces) There are more cute and funny cookie cutter shapes in our store for all kinds of holidays and parties, which can be purchased together. ➤Why choose us? ✔Safety service with Food-Safe Stainless Steel material. ✔Safety use service with smooth cutter edge and binding processed. don’t hurt your hand. ✔0.3 mm Thickness PK 0.2 mm usual thickness, hardly deformed, very durable. ★Tips：Hand wash, and dry immediately ➤Brand story We love life, and we use the metal cookie cutters to dress up the delicate and elegant rituals of different moments in life. We will always remember these wonderful things. ANPOPO is a professional biscuit cutting machine manufacturer with more than ten years of production experience, providing exquisite fondant/biscuit Cutters for customers in many countries. Making baking easy and making life cute and fun is our company's philosophy of developing high-quality cookie cutter with stencil set. ➤Service All of our products are delivered by Amazon, and ANPOPO is the sole brand owner of these cookie cutters. We offer a 100% satisfaction service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us by email and we will provide you with a replacement or free refund. This is the ANPOPO service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615nDRJrV5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANPOPO","source_asin":"B0857GX991","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0857GX991","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0857GX991","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994590,"name":"American DreamDNA 5lb Twin Size 3\" Made Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":676.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dNbCO+h9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Memory foam's ability to reduce pressure points is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep. Now you can enjoy the benefits of memory foam which reduces pressure points without having to buy a new mattress by adding this 5lb density memory foam mattress topper to your existing spring, latex, or even memory foam mattress. This topper will add comfort, help you sleep cooler and increase the quality of sleep from your mattress immediately. The three inches of 5lb density memory foam used in this topper is specifically designed to enhance the feel of your current mattress, and also provides additional support in areas where your mattress may be dipping or sagging. The foam is also specially formulated to contour to your body at any temperature, and will give you the extra cooling comfort you need to get the best night's sleep possible from your current mattress. Our 5lb density toppers have also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are manufactured, fabricated and packaged in the U.S.A. meeting all EPA and CSPC standards being safe and free from harmful chemicals found in many imported products. PURGreen uses independent laboratory results to qualify products and ensure they are manufactured without the use of ozone-depleting substances such as Chlorofluorocarbans, Polybrominated Diphenyl Ether substances, Harmful Metals, Formaldehyde, Prohibited Phalates or any other unsafe materials. PURGreen also implements baseline requirements such as conserving water, energy and other natural resources in the manufacturing processes established through internationally accepted ISO standards and procedures.***There may be a new foam smell associated with your new topper; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all PUrGreen, EPA and CSPC standards. AmericanMade by American Workers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dNbCO+h9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American","source_asin":"B00KV76JT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KV76JT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KV76JT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
