window.products.push({"id":994682,"name":"Arkwright Bulk Flat Microfiber Sheets - (6 Pack) Color-Coded Hem Threads Bedding Essentials Supplies for Hosts of Hotel, Motel, or Rental Properties, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511Ul0eFA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUY BULK AND SAVE: Arkwright Home presents bulk white Microfiber sheets in 6-packs and in bulk cases of 24 sheets. These pristine white sheets are perfectly suited for use in AirBnbs, VRBOs, guest houses, motels, camps, collegiate dorms, and spas, where linen turnover is higher than at home, however, bulk sheets are also perfect for large families or when buying for multiple properties like a primary residence and vacation home. Stock up on white sheets and save when you buy in bulk. TECHNOLOGICALLY ADVANCED MATERIAL: Microfiber is a soft, lightweight polyester fabric that is very durable. It is a breathable fabric that is wrinkle-resistant, dries quickly, and repels allergens and odors. These brilliant white sheets will stay bright and fresh when simple care instructions are followed. Soft and comfortable, these sheets are made of durable microfiber, a fabric that is designed to last. Stock up on fresh white sheets and minimize laundry time! LIGHT AND BREATHABLE: Microfiber is popular mostly because it is light and breathable. Made from synthetic fibers that are soft and smooth on skin and because they’re lightweight and breathable, they create a more comfortable sleeping experience. Microfiber is made from synthetic fibers and is, therefore, stronger than most sheet fabrics, thus ensuring a long lifespan, which saves you money! COLOR-CODED FOR EASY SORTING: Our Microfiber flat and fitted sheets have color-coded hem threads making it easy to identify sizes and sort them properly after laundering. The housekeeping staff won’t waste time finding the right size sheets, which saves money on labor. Hem thread colors are: Twin - black, Twin XL* - grey, Full - red, Queen - blue, King - green. *Twin XL is only available in fitted. EASY-CARE WASHING: These machine-washable sheets will last a long time with proper care. Machine wash in warm water and tumble dry on a low heat setting. A quick shake after drying will remove minor wrinkles. Microfiber sheets get softer after each washing but remain strong and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511Ul0eFA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arkwright LLC","source_asin":"B0BXN11BGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXN11BGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXN11BGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
