window.products.push({"id":994699,"name":"Brown Sugar Bear Harold Import Company brown sugar saversugar saver, 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HJXsiOvfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mrs. Anderson’s Brown Sugar Cookie is the perfect addition to baking supplies for preserving brown sugar and many other cooking and baking ingredients. Made from a specially fired clay, it helps to maintain desirable moisture levels in brown sugar and all types of sugar for approximately 3 to 6 months, depending on climate. No more chiseling through rock-hard sugar! Easy to use. Simply soak the Brown Sugar Cookie in clean water for 20-minutes, pat dry, and place it in with items in an airtight container. The water it absorbed will release slowly to help keep items moist longer. Should items begin to harden, just remove Brown Sugar Cookie and repeat the soaking process. Use after soaking to soften and maintain moisture in brown sugar, granulated sugar, sugar in the raw, turbinado sugar, and sugar substitutes, baked goods, cakes, cookies, marshmallows, even dried fruit. Or, use it dry without soaking to absorb moisture and keep spices, salt, crackers, pretzels and chips dry and crispy. Made from specially fired terracotta clay, Mrs. Anderson’s Brown Sugar Cookie is food safe and reusable, over and over again. Rinse with clean water only. Do not use soap as it could leave a trace taste or scent. Includes 2 Brown Sugar Cookie Savers. Brought to you by HIC Harold Import Co.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HJXsiOvfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B07BHF1M8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHF1M8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHF1M8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
