window.products.push({"id":994795,"name":"I Tri'd Triathlon Triathlete Swim Bike Run Tried Funny Acrylic Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eQSqV3o2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HOLIDAY CHEER TO SHARE: Put your own spin on holiday traditions with our heirloom-quality ornaments. Available in a variety of themes and fandoms, these cheerful ornaments have a personal feel and make a versatile holiday decoration. DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Crafted from high quality clear acrylic, our ornaments are printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulbs, our ornaments are shatterproof, making them perfect for families with kids or pets. Hanging cord included. Dimensions 3.0\" (7.6 cm) x 3.6\" (9.1 cm). FUN FOR KIDS, TEENS AND ADULTS: Suitable for all ages, these durable ornaments are great for accenting Christmas decorations, personalizing for loved ones, gift swaps, or just admiring. Perfect as holiday party favors, goodie bag fillers, team gifts, or anyone on your Nice list. All creative internal designs apply. In other words unlicensed. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eQSqV3o2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B076FBR7HX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076FBR7HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076FBR7HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994796,"name":"Rose Stem Bronze Memorial Keepsake for Loved Ones - Extra Small Holds 1 Cubic Inch of Ashes - Crimson Red Cremation Keepsake for Ashes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wIQ8VMItL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The Crimson Rose Keepsake Urn O my Luve is like a red, red rose That's newly sprung in June;O my Luve is like the melody That's sweetly played in tune. - Robert Burns Encapsulate the essence of the one you loved. Passion - deep, rich, and textured as the red of the funeral flower keepsake. Remember the rose that surprised you, that spoke what words cannot say. A courageous, vital love. Petals, delicate and velvety. Thorns protect a memory's beauty. This rose weathers any storm. Add engraving on the underside of the leaf, and this monogrammed cremation keepsake urn will represent a love that never dies.The rose is a symbol of eternal love, which means our OneWorld Memorials Crimson Red Rose With Bronze Stem Memorial Keepsake is the perfect way to protect the cremation ashes of a loved one. This cremation flower urn has a crimson red color in the flower petals, providing a beautiful display piece for up to one cubic inch of your loved one’s ashes. The brass construction in this red rose urn is lightweight and durable. You can purchase engraving separately, allowing you to add your loved one’s name, memorable dates or a message.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wIQ8VMItL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B07RWS7TKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RWS7TKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RWS7TKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
