window.products.push({"id":994820,"name":"Nouri Aromatherapy White Scented Candle, Long-Lasting, Non-Toxic, Perfect for Home, Relaxation, or Meditation, 110 to 150 Hours Burn Time, Black Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uF2lFn58L._AC_.jpg","description":"This Nouri Candle Large Jar Candle is the perfect size for enjoying all your go-to fragrances. The scented candle provides a long burn to add a pleasant aroma to dinner parties, lazy Saturdays, and a season's worth of little moments. Each candle from Nouri Candle is made with premium-grade paraffin candle wax with quality ingredients from around the world, and each wick is straightened by hand to ensure the best quality burn. Create comfort in your home year-round with the calming scent of vanilla cupcake, sure to bring out pleasant memories of baked pastries and fresh frosting. Whether you use the candle for decoration or aromatherapy, these scented candles are both heartwarming and housewarming, making an ideal gift for birthdays, anniversaries or party bags. ⦁ Nouri Lilac Blossoms Candle features the scent of An alluring grove of lavender, white, and purple lilacs. our Nouri Candles is Perfect for fragrance layering and sampling new scents and delivers up 110 to 150 hour burn time. - Ensure for the first burn to allow the wax to pool edge to edge before putting it out to avoid wick and tunneling issues - Keep wick trimmed to 1/4\" before lighting each time - Do not burn for more than 2 hours at a time - Remove all packaging including wick holder before lighting - Burn only on flat non-flammable surface - Always remove wick clippings and debris before lighting","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uF2lFn58L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08XB4ZFC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB4ZFC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB4ZFC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
