window.products.push({"id":994832,"name":"Stonehouse Collection Thanksgiving Table Tent Place Cards - 25 Thankgiving Turkey Guest Seating Name Cards - Table Tents - Placecards (Turkey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y4T+FbekL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Dress up you table with these fun and easy to fill out name cards for Thanksgiving. NO HOLDER NECESSARY: Folded tent place cards ship flat (3.5\"x4\") and scored for easy folding. When folded, these place cards measure 3.5\" x 2\". QUANTITY: These Thanksgiving table tents have a quantity of 25 and are printed on heavy 270 gsm flat card stock. DESIGNED AND MADE IN THE USA: Being a 40 year old family business, we pride ourselves on great customer service with 100% satisfaction guarantee (full refund, no questions asked), the most creative and fun products around and supporting USA and local businesses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y4T+FbekL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stonehouse Collection","source_asin":"B07YYLCTQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYLCTQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYLCTQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994833,"name":"Blinggasm 2 Ounce Pack, Almost 4,000 Water Jelly Beads, for Kids Tactile Sensory Experience, Wedding Centerpiece Vase Filler, Plant Decoration, Choose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819qTgRh0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Two ounce packs of water beads, 13 colors to choose from the menu . WHAT TO DO WITH WATER BEADS 1. Sensory Water Beads Sensory play is what water beads are best at. Kids of all ages love the feel and look of them. They are so enticing! Colorful, smooth, squishy, cool… Really, there’s not much more you need to do with water beads than have a bowl full of them to plunge your hands into and hold and squish them. Water beads seem like magic to kids because the beads start out so tiny and grow within a few hours. Just watching the beads change is a fun activity for younger kids. 2. Decorating with Water Beads The most common use for water beads is in decorating. Use them in vases, bowls, and jars for eye appeal. They are great for centerpieces for weddings and other events. The water beads really add a wow factor that can turn ordinary vases and bowls into something beautiful. 3. Water Beads for Plants Water beads are also great to use with plants. They help plants retain water and reduce the amount of watering plants need. They release the water gradually so the plant isn't flooded with water. The water beads can also act as a replacement for soil with some plants. Bamboo plants do well with water beads rather than soil. How to Use Water Beads 1. Apply the pack of Crystal Water Pearls in a large bowl of water. 2. Allow the beads to fully expand in 6-8 hours. 3. Remove the expanded beads from the water and pour into vases or bowls and ready to use. Package Includes: 2 oz Pack Of Blinggasm Water Beads. PLEASE NOTE: THESE BEADS ARE SOLD BY WEIGHT. THE ACTUAL NUMBER OF BEADS VARIES DUE TO THE SIZE OF THE DRY BEADS. THEREFORE, 4000 IS APPROXIMATE. YOU WILL NEVER GET LESS THAN 2 OZ.- GUARANTEED","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819qTgRh0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blinggasm","source_asin":"B01BB5EDO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BB5EDO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BB5EDO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
