window.products.push({"id":994909,"name":"Adamantite Portable Olive Oil Sprayer, 2 Pack 100ml Oil Spray, Spray Bottle Olive Oil Sparyer Mister for Cooking, BBQ, Salad, Baking, Roasting, Grilli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tavIeM0CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Preemium Quality - 304 stainless steel bottle lid - 304 food grade stainless steel, with large area press button, easy to press and control the dosage, anti-skid design with wave strips; with nozzle hiding inside the cap, anti- dust. no worry about leakage, eco-friendly material. (Contains：2 spray bottles, 2 colorful silicone folding funnels, 2 brushes) Multi-Purpose - This olive oil spray is tools for home & kitchen. It is reusable and multi-purpose. to spray any cooking oil, vinegar, juice, and wine etc. make it a fan pattern uniform mist, convenient during BBQ, making salad, baking, frying, grilling, season your food to be your preferred flavor through the dispenser bottle. Easy to Use & Clean - The attached small funnel allows you to fill up with oil more easily, and the unobstructed hose will not cause oil clogging. Simple pumping action that produces a fine mist, even spray, and more convenient control of dosage. After use, you can unscrew the lid and rinse with some detergent or warm water（With the attached brush, it is easier to clean the inside of the bottle） Easy to Carry - With our transparent design Eco- friendly, easy to clean, the size (100ml/3.4oz Capacity, Height 180mm/7.07inch x Diameter 40mm/1.57inch) can be used in the kitchen or carry out for picnic, BBQ, work lunch or travel, bring your own taste to anywhere, sturdy and durable, Or it is a great choice for gifts. Transparent and Double Scale Design：With transparent design, this oil dispenser is convenient to know the status and the amount of oil, easy to recognize the seasoning(oil/vinegar/sauce/red wine) quickly. Our two scale design can help you master oil usage in reference to different food cooking methods ,less calorie. High efficient use, without wasting. Improve the taste, more Healthy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tavIeM0CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adamantite","source_asin":"B09PHL1JSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PHL1JSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PHL1JSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
