window.products.push({"id":994911,"name":"HYOOLA Red Three Wick Large Candle - 6 x 3 Inch - Unscented Big Pillar Candles - 62 Hour - European Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7180lRh9LoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hyoola European Large Candles are the perfect addition to any occasion, creating a warm and inviting ambiance that lights up any environment. About This Product: - 3 wick candle  - Extra large candle  - Made In The EU by A Brand You Can Trust  - Packed securely in a cardboard box  - Lead-free 100% Cotton Wick, non-toxic  - Unscented three wick candle  - Dripless candle  - Indoor / Outdoor Use  - Bright Red candles  - 62 Hour Burn Time  - High Grade Paraffin Wax Great For Decorating Special Events Such As - Dining Room And Living Room  - Weddings  - Holiday Dinners  - Home Decor  - Parties  - Spa's  - Cozy nights at home while relaxing  - Bath Candle Set  - Event planners  - Emergency Candles For Blackouts ▪️ 6-inch diameter x 3-inch hight (150mm x 75mm) Burrning Tips: How to Burn Pillar Candles - The first time you burn your candle, leave it lit long enough so that a wax pool forms across the majority of the top portion of the candle. This is called a full pool. - When wax pool reaches the candle's edge, extinguish flame and allow candle to harden before relighting. This will prevent dripping. - Discontinue use when 1/2\" of wax remains at the bottom. - Trim the wick to ¼ inch before each burn. Invest in the best! Hyoola Decorative Pillars are made from Natural wax to ensure premium quality. Since its initial use, the candle has undergone an enormous development. Although it is no longer the most important light source of mankind, its popularity remains unbroken. Candles symbolize solemnity, stand for romance, calm the senses and set accents in decoration – a warm and wonderful sparkle to the delight of all. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility will brighten up your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7180lRh9LoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08FHDRN3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHDRN3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHDRN3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":994912,"name":"Inofia Full Mattress, Full Size Gel Memory Foam Hybrid Mattress, 10 Inch Individual Pocket Spring Double Mattress, Bed in a Box, Stronger Edge Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A1vpx89+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✪ 【Pressure Relieving & Motion Isolation】 --- 7-zone design of this hybrid Innerspring mattress conforms to body shape, it can support your body well from head to toe. The encased pocket coils work independently and you won’t be disturbed by your sleeping partner’s tossing on the bed. The mattress full provides you a soundly sleeping experience, very relax laying on this comfortable mattress. ✪ 【Right Support for All Sleepers】--- Responsive Memory foam adds softness to the mattress while the pocket coils underneath provide certain support, thus offering a mid-firm feeling. This luxury comfort mattress is suitable for each sleeping types, no matter you are side sleeper, back sleeper, or stomach sleeper. ✪ 【Healthy Cool Bed Mattress】 --- Smooth and soft top cover is natural and friendly to skin, absorb moisture and regulate body temperature. Side net mesh help dissipate heat and high quality carbon steel spring coils enhance airflow. CertiPUR-US Certified foam made WITHOUT harmful substances like formaldehyde, Mercury, and other heavy metals. Enjoy a NO worry sleep with your partner on Inofia full bed mattress. ✪ 【Mattress in a Box】 --- The 10 inch mattress is shipped rolled, compressed, and vacuum sealed in an easy to handle box. Very convenient to deliver and set up. Please let the mattress fully expand and enjoy your good nights sleep on Inofia mattress after 48 hours expansion. ✪ 【Good Fit & 100 Nights Trial at No Risk】 --- This mattress fits all frames, such as traditional bed frame, wooden frame, metal frame. Inofia offers you 100 sleep nights trail and 10-year limited guarantee as well as 30-day NO question asked refund if our mattress not satisfy you. Buy with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A1vpx89+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B07RQ82XJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQ82XJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQ82XJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
