window.products.push({"id":994926,"name":"French Press 5 Part Stainless Steel 3.75 Inch Wide Plunger Assembly For Flat Top 34 oz 8-Cup 1 Liter Coffee Press Replacement Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810imedI2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBLE TO USE WITH YOUR FLAT SHAPE LID - 5 PARTS: Cross, Filter and Spiral Plates, 7.00” Plunger Rod with Small Closed Nut and Solid SS Top Flat Knob - and NO LID - Use your own lid to repair your loyal French press; Fits a 3.75\" wide carafe with your FLAT lid perfectly and will do a great job filtering your coffee. DIRECTIONS FOR USE - Take apart your old plunger and thread the new rod into the hole on your flat lid, attach the flat solid knob to the top. Next, at the other end of the rod, start the finely threaded nut with round closed top facing the lid – if it gets “cross threaded” it could strip, so try to line it up correctly. ADD YOUR 3PC FILTER SEET - Spiral plate first (closest to the top), mesh filter in middle and cross plate below, poke the stem of the cross plate up through the mesh and spiral plates and screw the end of the rod into the internally threaded stem. Turn the closed nut to rest on your spiral plate. Good as new! GOOD QUALITY MATERIALS - 304 GRADE Stainless Steel (SS) PLUNGER ROD with closed nut, cross plate with internal threaded stem, spiral plate, one 18/8 SS wire mesh filter with a SS plunging knob; Try Cafe Crush Club's 34oz Replacement Glass - it's FIRE TOUGHENED with measures and our SS pour over filter with glass measure is deeply discounted and can be used on your French press carafe perfectly. Also Filter Parts, Cross, Filter and Spiral plate assemblies; and awesome cold brewing coffee gear. USE CASE - 7.00” rod for use with YOUR FLAT lid, like BODUM’s flat top Eileen, Brazil with flat lid, Kenya, STARBUCK's, BIALETTI's, MIRO, MENU, STERLING PRO's - GLASS or STEEL carafes in fact most FLAT lidded brands if they are 1 Liter, \"8-Espresso Cup\" 32|34oz French Press coffee makers. Not OEM Bodum, Compatibly Manufactured by Cafe Crush Club to use with your FLAT lid 1 Liter French Press. (OEM-Original Equipment Manufactured) DOME LID? Find our item B08CBTYKXX with a 7.75\" Rod to work for YOUR press. USA OWNED and SERVICED - \"Wonderful Product ... Retailer couldn’t not have been more helpful.\" CUSTOMER HAPPINESS IS OUR MOST IMPORTANT VALUE.\"Great Product! I bought this for my Starbucks 1 liter French press and am so happy with what I received. It fits perfectly (see photos), looks even sharper than the original setup that came with the French press, and was super easy to install. REPAIR IT - KEEP IT OUT OF THE LANDFILL - Do yourself a favor and buy this replacement part instead of buying a whole new container. I am happy that I did and look forward to continuing to use my French press for many years to come.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810imedI2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafe Crush Club","source_asin":"B0BM9PLWRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-994926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9PLWRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9PLWRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
